    <description>Removed Get Account Detail and fetch account feedback directly based on customer id (new formula field created)
Filter for AccFeedbackRecords - VP/CM/GM = userId or VP/CM/GM = null
UserId Fix
Added TA-VP,TA-CM,TA-GM
Modified condition for TA- Roles
Added Regional Admin Logic based on security mapping
Removed TA-CM
Regional Admin Account Detail Region = Security Mapping Region using Apex Action
Removed GM/CM/VP is null condition from decision
Added Account Owner is null false condition
Added RA check for Apex action</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>UserID</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>CASESAFEID({!$User.Id})</expression>
    </formulas>
